  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconstruction Assistance for Iraq. Phase IV: Strenghtening and Consolidating the Civilian Assistance 2009-2010.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From 2003-2008 funds were committed for reconstruction and humanitarian efforts in Iraq through the government finance committee&#xbf;s grant documents 111, 158, 105 and 106. 80 mio. DKK was granted to reconstruction aid in Iraq in 2009 and 2010 through the grant document 128 of June 2009.
The technical aid to Iraq has since 2007 been focused in capacity building in the Iraqi central administration via the Danish Technical Advisory Office (TAO) in Baghdad.</narrative>
  </description>
